# ⭐ **13. Rotation Clamping (Prevent Camera Flip)**

### **Purpose:** Limit up/down rotation

### **Signatures:**

```csharp
Mathf.Clamp(value, min, max);
Quaternion.Euler(x, y, z);
```

### Example:

```csharp
xRot = Mathf.Clamp(xRot, -80f, 80f);
transform.localRotation = Quaternion.Euler(xRot, yRot, 0);
```

